# Agency API key — create in your portal admin (API Keys → agency-scoped key). Give it the
# Reports capability (read + write); add Clients (write) too if you want to create/manage
# clients from Claude Code (see README). Used by BOTH the MCP connection (.mcp.json) and the
# sync script. This is the ONLY value you need to set. Never commit .env.
REPORTING_SUITE_API_KEY=secret_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
